{
  "question": "在一级标签“业务体验”下面，各三级标签的频次占比分别是多少？",
  "description": "在指定一级标签 {{primary_label}} 内统计三级标签分布，生成诉求类型和频次占比；频次占比以该一级标签总量为分母。",
  "dsl": {
    "size": 0,
    "query": {
      "bool": {
        "filter": [
          {
            "range": {
              "service_time": {
                "gte": "{{start_date}}",
                "lt": "{{end_date_exclusive}}"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "exists": {
              "field": "primary_labels"
            }
          },
          {
            "term": {
              "primary_labels": "{{primary_label}}"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "aggs": {
      "tertiary_by_primary": {
        "terms": {
          "field": "tertiary_labels",
          "size": 20
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
